{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZHmEYM7U611795169016.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>宏福苑大火近一周年，政務司司長陳國基表示，政府不會妨礙或阻止市民悼念，提醒市民要小心選擇。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207457-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E9%99%B3%E5%9C%8B%E5%9F%BA%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%83%E5%A6%A8%E7%A4%99%E6%88%96%E9%98%BB%E6%AD%A2%E6%82%BC%E5%BF%B5%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92%E8%A6%81%E6%85%8E%E9%81%B8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一周年‧現場｜陳國基：政府不會妨礙或阻止悼念　提醒要慎選</a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，前夫鄺港智繼續作供。他指無接觸過懷疑是兇器的圓頭鎚，又指案發當日，父親鄺球在車上單獨同蔡天鳳見面，其後就發現蔡天鳳頭部有血，倒臥車上。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207430-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E6%8C%87%E7%84%A1%E6%8E%A5%E8%A7%B8%E9%81%8E%E6%87%B7%E7%96%91%E5%85%87%E5%99%A8%E5%9C%93%E9%A0%AD%E9%8E%9A%E5%90%A6%E8%AA%8D%E8%A8%88%E5%8A%83%E8%A5%B2%E6%93%8A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港智指無接觸過懷疑兇器圓頭鎚　否認計劃襲擊</a></p><p></p><p>環保署建議修例向電動車供應商徵收「循環再造費」，按電池重量計算，並會逐年遞增。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207432-%E7%95%B6%E5%B1%80%E5%80%A1%E4%BF%AE%E4%BE%8B%E5%90%91%E9%9B%BB%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A%E4%BE%9B%E6%87%89%E5%95%86%E5%BE%B5%E5%BE%AA%E7%92%B0%E5%86%8D%E9%80%A0%E8%B2%BB%E6%8C%89%E9%9B%BB%E6%B1%A0%E9%87%8D%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%88%E7%AE%97%E9%80%90%E5%B9%B4%E9%81%9E%E5%A2%9E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">當局倡修例向電動車供應商徵「循環再造費」　按電池重量計算逐年遞增</a></p><p></p><p>立法會檢討三條過海隧道及大欖隧道分時段收費成效，運輸及物流局副局長廖振新指，措施成效顯著、建議維持。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207431-%E7%95%B6%E5%B1%80%E6%8C%87%E5%A4%9A%E6%A2%9D%E9%9A%A7%E9%81%93%E5%88%86%E6%99%82%E6%AE%B5%E6%94%B6%E8%B2%BB%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E6%88%90%E6%95%88%E9%A1%AF%E8%91%97%E5%BB%BA%E8%AD%B0%E7%B6%AD%E6%8C%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">當局指多條隧道分時段收費措施成效顯著　建議維持</a></p><p></p><p>寒冷天氣警告生效，正午時分各區氣溫普遍跌至約12度，明早氣溫預料仍然偏低。</p><p></p><p>➤ <a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207437-%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%99%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A9%E6%B0%A3%E6%BA%AB%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E13%E5%BA%A6%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%BF%9D%E6%9A%96\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣｜天文台料明早氣溫最低13度　提醒市民注意保暖</a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.114308+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":423,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:17:14.994445+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:19.810765+00:00","content_hash":"4e63026148b545a859cc89be24b184197f90b8be500439754b6f24fc9afac78d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.114308+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}